      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Jazz first spread beyond New Orleans in Mandeville, where bands played on steamboats and at dance halls in the late 19th century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        8,
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
